{
  "info": {
    "name": "Medicine OCR API",
    "_postman_id": "medicine-ocr-api-v2",
    "description": "Complete collection for the Medicine OCR API.\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Import this collection and the environment file\n2. Set `base_url` in the environment (default: `http://localhost:8000`)\n3. Run **Register** or **Login** — tokens are saved automatically\n4. All protected endpoints use `{{access_token}}` automatically\n\n**Auth flow:**\n- `POST /api/auth/register/` or `POST /api/auth/token/` → saves access + refresh tokens\n- Tokens are set as collection variables via test scripts\n- Use **Refresh Token** when access token expires",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {"key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string"}
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {"key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8000", "type": "string"},
    {"key": "access_token", "value": "", "type": "string"},
    {"key": "refresh_token", "value": "", "type": "string"},
    {"key": "medicine_id", "value": "1", "type": "string"},
    {"key": "reminder_id", "value": "1", "type": "string"},
    {"key": "reset_uid", "value": "", "type": "string"},
    {"key": "reset_token", "value": "", "type": "string"}
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔑 Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.access)  pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token',  json.access);",
                  "if (json.refresh) pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', json.refresh);",
                  "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('Has access token', () => pm.expect(json.access).to.be.a('string'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"testuser\",\n  \"email\": \"testuser@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"StrongPass123!\",\n  \"password2\": \"StrongPass123!\",\n  \"first_name\": \"Test\",\n  \"last_name\": \"User\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/register/", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "register", ""]}
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Get Tokens)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.access)  pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token',  json.access);",
                  "if (json.refresh) pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', json.refresh);",
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Has access token', () => pm.expect(json.access).to.be.a('string'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"testuser\",\n  \"password\": \"StrongPass123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/token/", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "token", ""]}
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Access Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.access)  pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token',  json.access);",
                  "if (json.refresh) pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', json.refresh);",
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {"type": "noauth"},
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/token/refresh/", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "token", "refresh", ""]}
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify Token",
          "request": {
            "auth": {"type": "noauth"},
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{access_token}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/token/verify/", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "token", "verify", ""]}
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/logout/", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "logout", ""]}
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get My Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/me/", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "me", ""]}
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update My Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"first_name\": \"Ahmed\",\n  \"last_name\": \"Hassan\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/me/", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "me", ""]}
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Change Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"old_password\": \"StrongPass123!\",\n  \"new_password\": \"NewStrongPass456!\",\n  \"new_password2\": \"NewStrongPass456!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/me/change-password/", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "me", "change-password", ""]}
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Request Password Reset",
          "request": {
            "auth": {"type": "noauth"},
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"testuser@example.com\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/password-reset/", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "password-reset", ""]}
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Confirm Password Reset",
          "request": {
            "auth": {"type": "noauth"},
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"uid\": \"{{reset_uid}}\",\n  \"token\": \"{{reset_token}}\",\n  \"new_password\": \"BrandNewPass789!\",\n  \"new_password2\": \"BrandNewPass789!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/password-reset/confirm/", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "password-reset", "confirm", ""]}
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "💊 Medicines",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Medicines",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/medicines/",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "medicines", ""],
              "query": [
                {"key": "page", "value": "1", "disabled": true},
                {"key": "page_size", "value": "20", "disabled": true}
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Search Medicines",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/medicines/?search=panadol",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "medicines", ""],
              "query": [{"key": "search", "value": "panadol"}]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Medicine",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/medicines/{{medicine_id}}/", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "medicines", "{{medicine_id}}", ""]}
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Medicine (Admin only)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"trade_name\": \"Panadol Extra\",\n  \"active_ingredient\": \"Paracetamol + Caffeine\",\n  \"strength\": \"500mg/65mg\",\n  \"dosage_form\": \"Tablet\",\n  \"drug_class\": \"Analgesic\",\n  \"common_side_effects\": \"Rare at recommended doses\",\n  \"serious_warning\": \"Do not exceed 8 tablets in 24 hours\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/medicines/", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "medicines", ""]}
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Medicine (Admin only)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"strength\": \"500mg\",\n  \"common_side_effects\": \"Nausea, rash\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/medicines/{{medicine_id}}/", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "medicines", "{{medicine_id}}", ""]}
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Medicine (Admin only)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/medicines/{{medicine_id}}/", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "medicines", "{{medicine_id}}", ""]}
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Medicine Interactions",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/medicines/{{medicine_id}}/interactions/", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "medicines", "{{medicine_id}}", "interactions", ""]},
            "description": "Returns all medicines that may conflict with the given medicine.\n\n**Response fields:**\n- `interaction_notes`: general interaction warnings\n- `similarity_risk_symptoms`: symptoms to watch for\n- `switching_note`: note about switching drugs\n- `total_conflicts`: number of conflicting medicines found\n- `conflicts[]`:\n  - `conflict_type`: `same_active_ingredient` or `similar_active_ingredient`\n  - `risk_level`: `high` (same ingredient = overdose risk) or `medium` (similar = interaction risk)\n  - `conflict_reason`: human-readable explanation\n  - `matched_ingredient`: the ingredient that triggered the match\n  - `medicine`: full medicine object"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
